<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβλαστ-άνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βλαστήσω</span>
		v. l. in <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			3.62
		</span></i>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έβλαστον</span> Id. (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εβλάστησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.):—<i>shoot up,</i> of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				835d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.366b
			</span></i>; of monstrous births, ib.<i><span class="en">
				991a
			</span></i>; <i>shoot afresh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.13
			</span></i>:—of a city, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ Συρήκουσαι] ἀνά τ᾽ ἔδραμον καὶ
					ἀνέβλαστον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.156
				</span></i>
			; of misfortunes, <i>spring up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔδει . . κακὰ ἀναβλαστεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.92
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ́,</span> cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.62
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀναβλαστάνουσα καθ᾽ ἡμέραν τιμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.769a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>put forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ψυχῆς ἔρνη διττὰ ἀναβλαστούσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.304
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.118
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρις πολέμους -ησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.235D.
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έω,</span>
			= foreg., <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				146.3
			</span></i>.</div>
